  {
    "episode_id": 95507,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/5/95507.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 13,
    "turn_text": "Yes, absolutely. I have two questions that have to do with the intelligence committee. These are from friends of mine. The first one is from Lauren Savon. She's a journalist and a good friend. And she said, if I could ask you, how do we keep the faith in our intel agencies with the president who constantly contradicts the little people and tweets out erroneous information? Like, why are we leaving it up to big tech companies to be the truth police? Why can't Congress do something?",
