    "turn_text": "Excellent. Thank you so much. My other question is from Leslie Hinksen. She's vice president for the National Racial Justice and Equity, the League of Conservation Voters. And she was wondering, she's not sure if it's within your purview, but can the committee push the FBI or whoever to put more resources into following hate groups within the USA?",
