  {
    "episode_id": 95507,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/5/95507.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 17,
    "turn_text": "It's so upsetting to me personally when I see that the president is lying because I know that people that are believers and follow him are going to believe him because we have a tendency to believe what we see. We believe what we hear. It's just sort of human nature. So it's hard to believe that somebody would lie. And unless you're really checking and double checking and triple checking different sources, people believe him.",
