        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Public trust in political figures is based primarily on perception rather than critical evaluation.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Lying by a prominent figure like the president has significant real-world consequences due to widespread belief.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker views truth-telling as morally essential in leadership.",
